{
  "name": "ATS Hiring-Intent (Greenhouse/Lever/Ashby) Chained to Zero-Browser DNS/DMARC/SSL Audit",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Dual-Hook B2B Intent: ATS Hiring Trigger -> Live Domain DMARC/SSL Audit\nChains two zero-proxy PipeForge Apify Actors:\n1. **US ATS Hiring-Intent Engine (`$4.00/1K`)** — Scans live Greenhouse, Lever, and Ashby boards for companies hiring `SOC 2`, `CISO`, `Security Engineer`, or `RevOps`.\n2. **B2B Domain DNS/DMARC/SSL Trigger (`$3.50/1K`)** — Automatically audits the hiring companies' domains via Google DoH + TLS port 443 for `p=none` DMARC, Proofpoint/Mimecast SEGs, and expiring SSL certs.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "ats-note-overview-b1c2",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [140, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 60-Second Setup (Header Auth)\n1. Create a **Header Auth** credential (`Authorization: Bearer YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN`).\n2. Attach it to both PipeForge HTTP Request nodes.\n3. Replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` and `YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID`.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "ats-note-setup-d3e4",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [740, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "ats-node-trigger-f5a6",
      "name": "Weekday 9AM EST Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [140, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/pipeforge~us-ats-hiring-intent-sales-triggers/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"platforms\": [\"greenhouse\", \"lever\", \"ashby\"],\n  \"intentCategories\": [\"SECURITY_COMPLIANCE_URGENCY\", \"REVOPS_GTM_STACK_BUYER\"],\n  \"maxPostingAgeDays\": 30,\n  \"maxCompanies\": 20,\n  \"limit\": 30\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "ats-node-fetch-b7c8",
      "name": "Fetch ATS Hiring-Intent Roles",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [400, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const DOMAIN_MAP = {\n  scaleai: 'scale.com',\n  datadog: 'datadoghq.com',\n  linear: 'linear.app',\n  elevenlabs: 'elevenlabs.io',\n  perplexity: 'perplexity.ai',\n  harvey: 'harvey.ai',\n  notion: 'notion.so',\n  ro: 'ro.co',\n  outreach: 'outreach.io',\n};\nconst domains = new Set();\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const direct = String(item.json?.company_domain || '').trim().toLowerCase();\n  if (direct) { domains.add(direct); continue; }\n  const slug = String(item.json?.company_slug || '').toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g, '');\n  if (slug) domains.add(DOMAIN_MAP[slug] || `${slug}.com`);\n}\nreturn [{ json: { domains: Array.from(domains).slice(0, 25), maxConcurrency: 5, timeoutSeconds: 6, minSeverityScore: 0 } }];"
      },
      "id": "ats-node-domains-d9e1",
      "name": "Build Unique Hiring Domains Batch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [660, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/pipeforge~b2b-domain-tech-stack-dns-ssl-sales-trigger/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "ats-node-dns-f2a3",
      "name": "Audit Domains via Google DoH & TLS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [920, 440]
